{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 60, :comments ["<b>You, be for thousands of myriads, etc.</b> The reason for its saying <b>you</b> — meaning: after Abraham was informed that thousands of myriads would come forth from Isaac, may it be HaShem's will that they come forth from you. And it would have been better for them that the matter not come to pass and not arise, and understand that every portion of evil hates the portion of good, even if it were his son and his daughter."], :book :genesis, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:43:10.932347811Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}